@startuml
title Delete Word Audio Sequence (/api/admin/words/{id}/audio/{audioId})
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Admin
boundary "Vocabulary UI" as VocabularyPage
control "VocabularyController\n(FE Dashboard)" as DashboardController
control "AdminWordsController\n(BE API)" as ApiController
control "WordAdminService" as WordService
control "IWordAdminService" as IWordAdminService
control "WordAdminRepository" as WordRepository
control "IWordAdminRepository" as IWordAdminRepository
entity "WordAudioAsset" as WordAudioAsset
database "VocaNovaDbContext" as DbContext
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
note over VocabularyPage, MySQL
Checked in current code:
Dashboard route is POST /vocabulary/{id}/audio/{audioId}/delete.
VocaNovaApiClient calls DELETE /api/admin/words/{id}/audio/{audioId}.
No request DTO body is used; API returns bool in the response envelope.
Delete is soft delete: audio status becomes deleted.
WordAudioAsset is the EF entity mapped to word_audio_assets.
Interfaces used in code: IWordAdminService, IWordAdminRepository.
end note
Admin -> VocabularyPage: Click Delete audio
VocabularyPage -> DashboardController: POST /vocabulary/{id}/audio/{audioId}/delete
DashboardController -> ApiController: VocaNovaApiClient.DeleteAudioAsync(wordId, audioId)\nDELETE /api/admin/words/{id}/audio/{audioId}
ApiController -> ApiController: Check admin authorization
ApiController -> IWordAdminService: SoftDeleteAudioAsync(wordId, audioId)
IWordAdminService -> WordService: SoftDeleteAudioAsync(wordId, audioId)
WordService -> IWordAdminRepository: SetAudioStatusAsync(wordId, audioId, deleted)
IWordAdminRepository -> WordRepository: SetAudioStatusAsync(wordId, audioId, deleted)
WordRepository -> DbContext: Query WordAudioAsset
DbContext -> MySQL: SELECT word_audio_assets
MySQL --> DbContext: Audio row or null
DbContext -> WordAudioAsset: Materialize entity
WordAudioAsset --> DbContext: WordAudioAsset or null
DbContext --> WordRepository: Result
alt Audio asset not found or already deleted
WordRepository --> WordService: false
WordService --> ApiController: NotFound result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 404 error
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show error message
else Audio asset found
WordRepository -> WordAudioAsset: Set Status = deleted
WordAudioAsset --> WordRepository: Entity updated
WordRepository -> DbContext: Save changes
DbContext -> MySQL: UPDATE word_audio_assets
MySQL --> DbContext: Update result
DbContext --> WordRepository: Save result
WordRepository --> WordService: true
WordService --> ApiController: Success result
ApiController --> DashboardController: HTTP 200 OK
DashboardController --> VocabularyPage: Show audio removed feedback
end
@enduml
